<title>LATVIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - AUG 4.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - AUG 4.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines on Latvian state radio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- Government party congresses are considering the nomination of Guntar Krasts as prime minister.</p>
<p>- President Ulmanis continues his visit to the U.S.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
